    "description": "Delight your loved ones with our exquisite flower bouquet, handcrafted by expert florists. This stunning arrangement features a lush collection of pristine white and delicate blush roses, artfully combined with ethereal baby's breath. The bouquet is elegantly wrapped in soft pink paper, creating a romantic and sophisticated presentation perfect for any special occasion.\r\nOur flowers are carefully selected for their freshness and quality, ensuring long-lasting beauty. The harmonious blend of roses and baby's breath creates a classic, timeless look that's ideal for birthdays, anniversaries, or as a heartfelt gesture of love and appreciation.\r\nThis flower basket alternative offers a modern twist on traditional bouquets, making it a versatile choice for home decor or as a thoughtful gift. The generous size and fullness of the arrangement make a striking impression, while the subtle color palette adds a touch of elegance to any setting.\r\nEach bouquet is uniquely crafted, reflecting the artistry of our florists. The finishing touch of a silver ribbon bow adds a luxurious detail, elevating this floral creation to a true work of art. Whether for personal enjoyment or as a memorable gift, this bouquet promises to bring joy and natural beauty into any space.\r\nPRODUCT INFO\u00a0\r\n\r\n \tFlower Identity : Light Peach (Semi-White) Roses\r\n \tQty of stems : 25 to 30\r\n \tFillers : Aspera grass\r\n\r\nDELIVERY INFO\u00a0\r\n\r\n \tSelect date &amp; time of delivery at the product page.\r\n \tMention any special requirement in the order notes section at the product page or contact us after placing the order.\r\n \tThe displayed image is indicative in nature.\r\n \tThe actual product may vary in size or shape or colour depending on the availability.",
