					<p class="price"><del aria-hidden="true"><span class="woocommerce-Price-amount amount"><bdi><span class="woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol">&#8377;</span>2,499.00</bdi></span></del> <span class="screen-reader-text">Original price was: &#8377;2,499.00.</span><ins aria-hidden="true"><span class="woocommerce-Price-amount amount"><bdi><span class="woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol">&#8377;</span>1,499.00</bdi></span></ins><span class="screen-reader-text">Current price is: &#8377;1,499.00.</span></p>
