				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-3f817275 elementor-widget elementor-widget-woocommerce-product-content" data-id="3f817275" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="woocommerce-product-content.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<p class="whitespace-pre-wrap break-words">Delight your loved ones with our exquisite flower bouquet, handcrafted by expert florists. This stunning arrangement features a lush collection of pristine white and delicate blush roses, artfully combined with ethereal baby&#8217;s breath. The bouquet is elegantly wrapped in soft pink paper, creating a romantic and sophisticated presentation perfect for any special occasion.</p>
<p class="whitespace-pre-wrap break-words">Our flowers are carefully selected for their freshness and quality, ensuring long-lasting beauty. The harmonious blend of roses and baby&#8217;s breath creates a classic, timeless look that&#8217;s ideal for birthdays, anniversaries, or as a heartfelt gesture of love and appreciation.</p>
<p class="whitespace-pre-wrap break-words">This flower basket alternative offers a modern twist on traditional bouquets, making it a versatile choice for home decor or as a thoughtful gift. The generous size and fullness of the arrangement make a striking impression, while the subtle color palette adds a touch of elegance to any setting.</p>
<p class="whitespace-pre-wrap break-words">Each bouquet is uniquely crafted, reflecting the artistry of our florists. The finishing touch of a silver ribbon bow adds a luxurious detail, elevating this floral creation to a true work of art. Whether for personal enjoyment or as a memorable gift, this bouquet promises to bring joy and natural beauty into any space.</p>
<p><b>PRODUCT INFO </b></p>
<ul>
<li>Flower Identity : Light Peach (Semi-White) Roses</li>
<li>Qty of stems : 25 to 30</li>
<li>Fillers : Aspera grass</li>
</ul>
<p><b>DELIVERY INFO </b></p>
<ul>
<li>Select date &amp; time of delivery at the product page.</li>
<li>Mention any special requirement in the order notes section at the product page or contact us after placing the order.</li>
<li>The displayed image is indicative in nature.</li>
<li>The actual product may vary in size or shape or colour depending on the availability.</li>
</ul>
				</div>
				</div>
